    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Available Immediately\r\n\r\nLetting Solutions is delighted to present Avalon, Malahide—a stunning six-bedroom, five-bathroom home located just off the Estuary Road in a private lane.\r\n\r\nThe property is ideally situated approximately three minutes from Malahide village, the DART station, the beach and marina. Malahide offers an abundance of restaurants, bars, shops and boutiques, as well as Malahide Golf Club, tennis and cricket clubs, and the beautiful Malahide Park and Castle. Excellent primary and secondary schools are also nearby.\r\n\r\nProperty Description\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you arrive, this impressive home makes a striking impression. The entrance opens into a bright hallway with ample storage.\r\n\r\nTo the left is a spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area. The light walnut kitchen features granite surfaces, black worktops and a stunning island. Glass doors lead directly to the beautifully landscaped rear garden.\r\n\r\nThis level also includes three large bedrooms, including a master bedroom with an en-suite bathroom and glass doors opening onto the garden.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, a light-filled staircase, long window and roof lights create a bright and welcoming atmosphere. The upper floor features an impressive sitting room with floor-to-ceiling glass doors and stunning sea views. Finished and furnished to a high standard, and open glass door solid fuel fire .\r\n The room opens onto a brand-new balcony overlooking Malahide village.\r\n\r\nThis level also includes a separate utility room, main bathroom and access to the balcony. There are three further bedrooms, all with sea views, including a second master bedroom with an en-suite bathroom.\r\nThis family home is furnished and finished to a very high standard and must be seen to to be appreciated. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nGardens\r\n\r\nThe property has landscaped gardens to the front and rear, together with a garden shed.\r\n\r\nPlease contact Patricia at Letting Solutions with your expression of interest:\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended — photos don’t do this property justice, it must be seen to be appreciated."
      },
